# Ares, God of War: "Ares attacks each combat if able" (CR 508.1d): declaring no attackers is refused. "Whenever an
# attacking creature you control dies, return that card to its owner's hand": Hill Giant blocks and kills Ares, who was
# attacking, so he returns to Bot1's hand (the trigger sees him as he last was, CR 603.10a). Hill Giant dies too, and goes
# to Bot2's graveyard: it is not Bot1's creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ares, God of War
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hill Giant
Island x15

